OL,4,CMinister steps in after 6,000 homes    
OL,5,Cditched from plan                      
OL,6,GThe government has stepped in after an 
OL,7,GEssex council removed almost 6,000     
OL,8,Ghomes from its local plan.             
OL,10,FIn September, Rochford District        
OL,11,FCouncil voted to remove six major      
OL,12,Fsites from its draft local plan which  
OL,13,Fhalved its potential provision of      
OL,14,Fhomes from 11,783 to 5,897.            
OL,16,FMatthew Pennycook, Minister for        
OL,17,FHousing and Planning, was not          
OL,18,Fsatisfied with the reasons behind the  
OL,19,Fcouncil's decision and has written a   
OL,20,Fletter ordering them to submit a local 
OL,21,Fplan for examination by 31 March 2027. 
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
