OL,4,CDriver admits causing death of 13-year-
OL,5,Cold cyclist                            
OL,6,GA man has admitted causing the death   
OL,7,Gof a teenage cyclist on the second day 
OL,8,Gof his trial.                          
OL,10,FAlfie Brown, 13, died at the scene of  
OL,11,Fa collision in Swafield, near North    
OL,12,FWalsham in Norfolk, in August 2023.    
OL,14,FAt Norwich Crown Court on Tuesday,     
OL,15,FJames Durham, 55, of Mundesley,        
OL,16,Fadmitted a charge of causing death by  
OL,17,Fcareless driving.                      
OL,19,FA charge of causing death by dangerous 
OL,20,Fdriving against Durham was dropped.    
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
